---
title: Oreo Fluff
description: The staple for any picnic / family event.
servings: 6
image: https://beamingbaker.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Oreo-Fluff-Recipe-2-1024x1536.jpg
---

Beat together @vanilla instant pudding {1%3oz pkg} and @milk{2%cups} in a #small bowl{}.

Fold in @Oreo cookies{30}(crushed), @marshmellows{8%oz}(miniature), and @whipped topping{16%oz}.

Cover and refrigerate for ~{2-3%hours}.